silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_06_yoneda_closure_sections_01_profile_comparison_concrete_anchor#mittensgovernedindividual silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedIndividual is the governed Mittens individual at Tartu Animal Clinic, annual vet exam 2026-05-18. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
