silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_06_yoneda_closure_sections_01_profile_comparison_concrete_anchor#profilecomparisonsymbol silm:hasLongDescription "The ProfileComparisonSymbol is Profile comparison for Mittens: the incoming arrows to Mittens include type/evidence/quality/process/role/taxonomy/validation probes; the incoming arrows to the Icechunk chunk include only hash-verification/manifest-entry/return-path probes. The comparison proves the two Hom-sets are different." .
